1 NAME Peter Danielsson /Svedberg/
2 GIVN Peter Danielsson
2 SURN Svedberg
2 _MARNM Schönström
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Hed Church
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Hed
