1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She was a daughter of a plantase owner from Mantua Greek, West Jersey. Maria and Anders got 6 sons and one daughter in America. Two of them died as small children, Peter 1708 and Anders 1711. The names became inher
2 CONC ited by their brothers. The family moved from America to Hedemora, Sweden, in 1719. In Sweden they got four children more. Source Robert Brantberg, Sandels Sotamarsalkka ja suurmies
