1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Catharina Lindren died in 1817 ca, she was 'married" to the caretaker Anders Lindgren. Her daughter Amalia born May 22, 1814 in Stockholm the wealthy widow of her alleged biological father,  became her custodian. Amalia's pos
2 CONC ition as a child was somewhat humiliating, as a form of charity object for the upper classes, and in her later work, her paintings of sad little girls are believed to be inspired by her childhood.
2 CONT
2 CONT excerpted from Wikipedia and Pinterest by Janet Milburn on 10-15-18
