1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Drafted a plan in 1768 for the establishment of a new "northern providence' for which the capitol would be Crown Point on Lake Champlain.  His plan was sent to the king for approval, but no further action was taken
2 CONC .  Eventually, the village fell into disrepair and the village was destroyed by fire in October 1776.  After Adolphus died at Crown Point in 1774/1775, Rebecca went back to Wilmington, DE and she remarried William Killen on Novemb
2 CONC er 26, 1783.  William was the Chief Justice of Delaware State.
2 CONT
2 CONT Met Benjamin Franklin in London
