2 CONC c4995048cb0 MyHeritage Family Trees] via sister [http://www.geni.com/profile-34679111695 Magdalena Jedeur (born Wallvik)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 15 2015, 13:01:28 UTC''
