1 NOTE Peter Gunnarsson Rambo immigrated from Sweden to Philadelphia, Pennsylvania in Winter, 1639 on the "Kalmar Nyckel". He arrived in Delaware on April 17, 1640 Peter chose his name after Rambo, Sweden. There also is the "Rambo Apple"
2 CONC  named after Rambo, Sweden, still grown in northeastern Sweden. 
1 NOTE [Brøderbund WFT Vol. 1, Ed. 1, Tree #2818, Date of Import: Dec 30, 1997]
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter Gunnarson Rambo arrived in America on April 17, 1640.  His ship,Kalmar Nyckel, reached port in New Sweden after a far from pleasantjourney.
2 CONT
2 CONT For a description of the trip, early times in the colony of New Swedenand Peter's early life, see Document File.  All of the information on theRambos was taken from the following book available at the Carnegie FreeLibrary,
2 CONT Beaver Falls, Pennsylvania, on April 20, 1995:
2 CONT
2 CONT                    The Rambo Family Tree
2 CONT      Descendants of Peter Gunnarson Rambo, 1611-1986
2 CONT
2 CONT      by Beverly Nelson Rambo, MA, MN
2 CONT           Commander, (NC) USNR, Ret.
2 CONT
2 CONT      The Anundsen Publishing Company
2 CONT      108 Washington Street, Box 230
2 CONT                 Decorah, Iowa  52101
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Please address correspondence and book orders to:
2 CONT
2 CONT      Beverly Rambo
2 CONT      4606 Maytime Lane
2 CONT      Culver City, CA 90230
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Library of Congress Catalog Card Number:  86-72551
2 CONT
2 CONT The family were Lutheran, and Peter Gunnarson Rambo was one of thefounders and longtime vestryman of one of the first Swedish churches inAmerica, located at Wicaco, a short distance south of Penn's Landing inPhiladelphia.  When a 
2 CONC new church was built it was erected over the graveof Peter which is under the altar.  Gloria Dei (Old Swede's) Church stillstands in Philadelphia, and is a National Historic Shrine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Peter and Britta who grew to adulthood:
2 CONT
2 CONT      Gunnar Rambo        January 16, 1648/49
2 CONT      Gertrude Rambo      October 19, 1650
2 CONT      Peter Rambo         June 17, 1653
2 CONT      Catherine Rambo          1655
2 CONT      Andrew Rambo        1658
2 CONT      John Rambo          1661
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
