1 NOTE Pastor of the Gloria Dei Church where many early Rambo records are found.He was from Gestricia, Norrland, and arrived on the Delaware in 1697 withhis assistant, Eric Bjork.  Rev. Rudman developed poor health as a resultof pulminar
2 CONC y problems, so he moved to New York with his family.  Hishealth did not improve in the climate there, and he returned to thechurch at Oxford, PA where he died on Sept. 17, 1708 at age 39.
