1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gunnar Rambo, born January 6, 1649, died January 1724 at the age of 75 at "Matzong" in Upper Merion township of present Montgomery County, Pa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Anna Cock (daughter of Peter Cock)
2 CONT
2 CONT Had nine children. Details:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. GUNNAR RAMBO, Peter's eldest son, was born 6 Jan 1648/49 and married ANNEKA COCK in 1670. A'''nneka was born about 1652, a daughter of Peter Larsson and Margaret (Lom) Cock''' and a sister of Maria and Brigitta Cock who married
2 CONC  Gunnar's younger brothers Anders [#5] and John [#6]. (The Cock family is given at the end of this chapter
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunnar and Anna had the following children:
2 CONT * 	11.  JOHN RAMBO, Jr., b. ca 1673, d. ca 1746, m. 1) Anna Laicon, 2) Sarah (?)
2 CONT * 	12.  PETER RAMBO, b. ca 1678, d. Jul 1753, m. ?
2 CONT * 	13.  GUNNAR RAMBO, b. ca 1680, d. 1717-1724, unmarried
2 CONT * 	14.  ANDERS RAMBO, b. ca 1682, d. 3 Jul 1755 unmarried
2 CONT * 	15.  MNS RAMBO, b. ca 1684, d. Apr 1760, m. Catharina Boon
2 CONT * 	16.  BRIGITTA RAMBO, b. ca 1685, m. Matthias Holstein
2 CONT * 	17.  GABRIEL RAMBO, b. ca 1687, d. ca Nov 1734, m. Christian (?)
2 CONT * 	18.  MATTHIAS RAMBO, b. ca 1690, d. before 1724
2 CONT * 	19.  ELIAS RAMBO, b. ca 1693, will proved 1 Oct 1750, m. Maria Van Culen
2 CONT
