2 CONT John died sometime between signing his will on November 27, 1745, andprior to January 6, 1746, when his will was probated.  This will namedthe children born to his first wife, Anna, and those born to his secondwife, Sarah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children born to John and Anna:
2 CONT      Peter Rambo         pre 1697
2 CONT      MONS RAMBO          abt 1700
2 CONT      Gabriel Rambo
2 CONT      Michael Rambo
2 CONT      Ann Rambo      abt 1716
2 CONT      Elcande (Eleanor) Rambo
2 CONT      Ezekiel Rambo       abt 1723
2 CONT
2 CONT John's second wife named Sarah survived him, but her date of death isunknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children born to John and Sarah:
2 CONT      Gunnar Rambo
2 CONT      Maudlin Rambo
2 CONT      Lydia Rambo
2 CONT      Israel Rambo
2 CONT
