1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LFS1-936/peter-rambo-1724-1788
2 CONT
2 CONT '''==Biography==
2 CONT '''Peter Rambo, Sr.''' was born on January 2, 1679 in Philadelphia, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34694735875 Gunnar Peterson Rambo] and [https://www.geni.com/prof
2 CONC ile-15209075 Anna or Anneka Petersdotter Cock]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter married [https://www.geni.com/profile-70876689 Magdalin Baurin] in 1703 in Philadelphia, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-69807372 Anna
2 CONC  Rambo]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-83186376 Mary Rambo]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34693891498 John Rambo]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-83186484 Peter Rambo, Jr.]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-83186517 William Rambo]; [
2 CONC https://www.geni.com/profile-83186564 Gunnar Rambo]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 10, 1753 in Upper Providence, Philadelphia, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==pew chart at Saint James Perkiomen==
2 CONT Peter Rambo, father of Gunnar, was at St. James Church prior to 1736, and an early Vestryman. Other sons of Peter on this chart include William, the husband of Hannah Lane, and John, husband of Ann Lane (Pew Chart #18). Sophia Kop
2 CONC lin, wife of Isaiah Davis, and Moses Rambo were 1st cousins.
