1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Brigitta Gunnarssdotter Holstein (Rambo)''' was born on November 15, 1685 in Passyunk, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34694735875 Gunnar Peterson Rambo] and [https://www.geni.com
2 CONC /profile-15209075 Anna Petersdotter Rambo (Cock)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Brigitta married [https://www.geni.com/profile-63613782 Matthias Claessen Holstein, Jr.] on October 10, 1705 in Old, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. Together they had the following children:# 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477150 Peter Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34747453958 Frederick Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477211 Bridget Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477262 Catharina Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477300 Debora Priest (Holstein)];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477324 Andrew Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477361 Matthias Holstein, III];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477393 Mary Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477413 Brita Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477448 John Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-83453835 Catherina Werner (Holsteiner)];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477482 Elisabeth Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-92477530 Frederick Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34747453959 Britta Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34747453963 Richard Holstein];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34747453961 Brichard Holstein]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1758 in Upper Merion, Montgomery, Pennsylvania, USA. 
