2 CONT Lawrence Bankston, Sr. and his wife Rebecca Hendricks, both born in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, Lawrence in 1704 and Rebecca in 1705.1704 Birth - Lawrence BANKSON, son of Andrew BANKSON Jr. and Gertrude (Lars Boore ) , in Philadel
2 CONC phia, Pennsylvania.1725 Marriage - Rebecca Hendricks b. ca., 1705, daughter of John Hendricksand Rebecca Wells.1727 Birth son, Andrew1729 Birth son, Peter1730 Birth Son Lawrence, Jr. (d. before 1787)1731 Birth son, Danielabt 1731 
2 CONC Birth son, JacobBetween 1729-1732 . birth of a daughter who married a James Lea. both diedin Caswell County, North Carolina
2 CONT When Capt. Lawrence Bankston Sr. was born in 1704, in Philadelphia, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, his father, Andres Andrew Bankston Jr., was 33 and his mother, Gertrude Lars Boore, was 34. He married Rebec
2 CONC ca Hendricks in 1726, in Philadelphia, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 1 daughter. He died in 1774, in Anson, North Carolina, British Colonial America, at the age 
2 CONC of 70."Swedish Colonial Society Genealogist edits : There is no  documentatation  for a middle name for Lawrence b. 1704. There is no known death date, nor location, apart from "before the Rev War."
