2 CONC en the latter attended the wedding of [https://www.geni.com/people/Jonas-Aur%C3%A9n/6000000000117911658 Jonas Aurén] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Lydia-Aur%C3%A9n/6000000004274497004 Lydia Justis]. 
2 CONT * https://books.google.se/books?id=5TwW25t42BEC&pg=SL5-PA27&lpg=SL5-PA27&dq=Jonas+Auren,+Cecil+County,+MD&source=bl&ots=cJ9CrLKNjZ&sig=ACfU3U0-q7NaUgjDgsAGawXyY-1rB47dog&hl=en&ppis=_e&sa=X&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q=Jonas%20Auren%2C%
