1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles Friend BIRTH	1699 DEATH	1751 (aged 51–52) Williamsport, Washington County, Maryland, USA BURIAL	 Friend's Family Cemetery Williamsport, Washington County, Maryland, USA  MEMORIAL ID	87119739 · View Source
