2 CONT *Birth*	John Matson was born say 1673?  He was the son of John Matson and Mary (?). 
2 CONT *Marriage*	He married Hanna (?) say 1703?. 
2 CONT *Death*	John died on 2 March 1748 in Chester County, Pennsylvania, .[2] 
