1 NAME Edward /Sinnexon/
2 GIVN Edward
2 SURN Sinnexon
2 _MARNM Barton
2 NICK Sinnicksson
2 NICK Broer
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1650
2 PLAC Sweden/Finland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 NOV 1708
