1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Andrew Richman, son of Jacob Richman and Catherine Matson, was b. c1747 in Pilesgrove Twp., Salem Co., New Jersey. He married, on Apr. 28,1778 in Pilesgrove Twp., Salem Co., New Jersey,  with EUNICE MILLER, dau. of
2 CONC  John Miller and Rachel Reed. She was b. Oct. 1,1747 in Hopewell, Cumberland, New Jersey. He d. before June 28,1782 in Gloucester Co., New Jersey.
