1 NOTE John was pastor of the Gloria Dei Church from May 17, 1737 until hisdeath in 1741.  He was described as the most popular and ablest pastorsent to America by the Swedish government.  He was a fluent linguist whopreached two sermons
2 CONC  each Sunday morning, one in German, and one inSwedish.  He then delivered a sermon in English to an Englishcongregation in the afternoon.
