1 OCCU Fil. Mag., Prost, Kyrkoherde
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.tjocka.nu/heritage/i271.htm#i193
2 CONT
2 CONT Prost i Södra Rörum o. Häglinge. SSK30. Per: Student 1754, prästvigd i okt 1760, magister 1763, 6 aug 1780 pastor i Södra Rörum o. Häglinge, 1786 prost där.
2 CONT
2 CONT !BIRTH: St. Petri parish reg. FHL #146188 pg 156.
2 CONT
2 CONT MARR #1: Elsa Maria Lorich dau of Pastor Hans Peter Lorich (son of Metta
2 CONT
2 CONT Hartman 24/25B & her 2nd husband Pastor Hans Lorich). It is Hans Peter L. who
2 CONT
2 CONT wrote in his biography the history of the Flensburg family. NOTE: "Svensk
2 CONT
2 CONT Slägt-Kalender 1887" gives marr in 1774 "with half cousin".
2 CONT
2 CONT MARR #2: Christiana Elisabet DANCKWARDT place of marr not given in husbands
2 CONT
2 CONT biography. Biog lists no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: His biog LSH/Carlquist FHL #1440048 vol 6, pg 118, #15.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: "Attended school in Malmö listed 16 Dec 1751(Blekinge nation 16 Jul 1754)
2 CONT
2 CONT Afterwords called to Osby parish to be assistant to his fathers half-brother
2 CONT
2 CONT (Pastor Hans Peter Lorich) 7 Sep 1760. Became pastor of S. Rörum & Hjärsås, Mal
2 CONT
2 CONT county 6 Sep 1780". (source his biog LSH/Carlquist FHL #1440048, vol 6, pg118.
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER SOURCES: "Svenskt Biog Lexikon" pg168, "Svensk Slägt-Kalender" 1887.
