2 CONT Hedvig Tersmeden (née Wegelin 31 October 1766 – 18 August 1842)[1] was a Swedish noblewoman, Swedish artists' model, known for being the depicted woman in a painting by Carl Fredrik von Breda[2] named Hedvig Wegelin with daughters
2 CONC .[3] Hedvig Wegelin is a direct ancestor of the Hereditary Princess of Liechtenstein.
